@startuml SplitSmartArchitecture
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
left to right direction

actor User
rectangle "Web Browser" as Browser
rectangle "Web UI Layer" as UI
rectangle "Application Services" as Services
rectangle "Domain Model" as Domain
rectangle "Persistence Layer" as Persistence
rectangle "Relational Database" as DB
rectangle "Security / Authorization" as Security
rectangle "Notification Service" as Notifications

User --> Browser
Browser --> UI
UI --> Services
Services --> Security
Services --> Domain
Services --> Persistence
Persistence --> DB
Services --> Notifications

note right of Domain
  Account
  Group / Membership
  Expense / Allocation
  ReviewDecision
  Payment
  BalanceView
end note

note bottom of Security
  Enforces private account visibility,
  group membership rules, and manager permissions.
end note

@enduml
